From d702c7070694e583d67eb20288f1ab3ebd1ce081 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@accounts.eddster.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 18:22:49 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] offline: remove Google Analytics, vendor CSS and Virgil
 font

open-color and normalize.css are now served from vendor/ instead of
cdnjs/jsdelivr, the Virgil font from vendor/Virgil.woff2, and all
external meta/links in index.html are dropped.
---
 index.html                |  72 +-------
 style.css                 |   2 +-
 vendor/Virgil.woff2       | Bin 0 -> 56156 bytes
 vendor/normalize.css      | 349 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 vendor/open-color.min.css |   2 +
 5 files changed, 360 insertions(+), 65 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 vendor/Virgil.woff2
 create mode 100644 vendor/normalize.css
 create mode 100644 vendor/open-color.min.css

diff --git a/index.html b/index.html
index ce637e0..222b5a0 100644
